OL,5,G2200 999: Emergency Call Out
OL,6,     FAn air ambulance responds in
OL,7,     FQueenborough after a 12-year-old
OL,8,     Fis hit by a car going 50 miles per
OL,9,     Fhour; a gang of youths prevent
OL,10,     Fresponders from helping.
OL,11,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,12,     FDoctors have minutes to save a
OL,13,     Fman's sight in East London after a
OL,14,     Fviolent attack, while in Belfast
OL,15,     Furgent tests assess an elderly
OL,16,     Ffarmer with suspected
OL,17,     Flife-threatening abdominal pain.
