OL,5,G0000 Fatal First Dates
OL,6,     FWhen a teenager is brutally
OL,7,     Fmurdered after running away to
OL,8,     Fmeet the boy of her dreams, police
OL,9,     Funcover a twisted plot with a
OL,10,     F50-year-old predator posing as a
OL,11,     Fyoung man to groom her.
OL,12,G0100 Acts of Murder
OL,13,     FThree sleuths, trained in exposing
OL,14,     Fthe lies behind a serial killer's
OL,15,     Fperformance, examine the case of
OL,16,     Fserial killer John Wayne Gacy,
OL,17,     Fknown as 'the Killer Clown'. (Ep2)
